                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fa9d84d0-9271-383b-b5ad-255c15d39e8b",
                        "entry_id": "32a19a2c-c746-39b3-b9e9-94e64d15d6fc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "воен., устар. разрывной, взрывной; дробящий"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "61534012-3f76-44f4-92ae-2a29697bd367",
                                "sense_id": "fa9d84d0-9271-383b-b5ad-255c15d39e8b",
                                "text": "«Вбегают в фанзу с весёлыми лицами два солдатика и приносят две бризантные не разорвавшиеся гранаты, от которых с ужасом отшатываются сидевшие и пившие чай»."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "14347fb1-38f0-488d-a4b0-8382e5872442",
                                "sense_id": "fa9d84d0-9271-383b-b5ad-255c15d39e8b",
                                "text": "Ты знаешь, между прочим, шрапнель, когда летит, так как-то особенно шуршит. А бризантный снаряд воет, как собака."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5125ca9-2a26-4f4a-bb8c-17ca08377ac5",
                                "sense_id": "fa9d84d0-9271-383b-b5ad-255c15d39e8b",
                                "text": "Детонирующие вещества обладают так называемым бризантным, т. е. дробящим, действием, их эффект практически не зависит от толщины оболочки."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "48bb3b20-1ce7-460c-b91c-4ce81faebde8",
                        "source_entry_id": "32a19a2c-c746-39b3-b9e9-94e64d15d6fc",
                        "source_sense_id": "fa9d84d0-9271-383b-b5ad-255c15d39e8b",
                        "target_lang_word": "brisant",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "brisant",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "77103143-4e33-37ce-883c-840197405011",
                                        "entry_id": "222539f8-3c33-3b12-96f5-9bde20212362",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having a shattering effect."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9393bafb-c03e-44e0-97e2-5416c7af4c39",
                                                "sense_id": "77103143-4e33-37ce-883c-840197405011",
                                                "text": "The use of gun-cotton proper (trinitrocellulose) could not be thought of, owing to the brisant action of this body, but it was found that collodion-wool (dinitrocellulose, soluble gun-cotton), which was less brisant, could be converted into a nearly homogeneous mass which satisfied many of the requirements of a smoke-free powder, but it was still so brisant when used alone as to produce too high gas pressures and too irregular initial velocities."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff72e964-70c5-4bce-a034-ef2a23bf55e3",
                                                "sense_id": "77103143-4e33-37ce-883c-840197405011",
                                                "text": "1959, Mitchel H. Bertram, William V. Feller, Memorandum 5-24-59L: A Simple Method for Determining Heat Transfer, Skin Friction, and Boundary-Layer Thickness for Hypersonic Laminar Boundary-Layer Flows in a Pressure Gradient, NASA, 5,\nAt the start of the run a shattering or \"brisant\" detonation occurred in the line between the oxidant control valve (number 5, fig. 2(a)) and the oxidant tank. […] The propellant tank showed evidence of high internal pressure but no brisant detonation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "708506f7-ab45-4f4e-be9e-58fc7f8f4f97",
                                                "sense_id": "77103143-4e33-37ce-883c-840197405011",
                                                "text": "Two charges should be used: a cratering charge, and a small charge of a brisant explosive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63dfcf53-50e2-45c6-a160-68b1b001f36f",
                                                "sense_id": "77103143-4e33-37ce-883c-840197405011",
                                                "text": "It is highly brisant with a VoD of 7300 ms-1 at a charge density of approximately 1.5 g cm-3."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
